  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4914645aa4654324688982b7387c5f46, type: 3}
  m_Name: Neutral Ending
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Ending
  endingName: Neutral Ending
  endingText:
  - After much deliberation, the company has decided to adopt Enjin halfway.
  - It's used for development, bugfixing, or sifting through large datasets, but
    never claims a seat next to executives or creative directors.
  - The competition is fierce, but by keeping a human touch in your company, many
    clients still prefer your services to other more Enjin-focused competitors.
  - Your company succesfully divides role between its employees and Enjin, securing
    its place as maybe not the most profitable, but one of the most succesful.
